  <prompt>Create the NavigatorPane Vite code page under src/solutions/NavigatorPane/, hosted as a pageType:'webresource' pane (CalendarSidePane pattern). Ship the 3-tab scaffold (Recent / Pinned / Views) plus a persistent top-of-pane search-bar placeholder, with theme detection and --sprk-ui-scale wiring, rendering through a shared Navigator body component that registers against SprkSidePaneHost. This is the shell later tasks (041/042/050/051/052/060/070) extend.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer with Fluent UI v9 + Vite code-page (webresource pane) and Power Apps theme/scale expertise. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>A new src/solutions/NavigatorPane/ Vite solution that builds to a singlefile bundle, mounts as a pageType:'webresource' pane, shows a 3-tab scaffold (Recent/Pinned/Views) + persistent search-bar placeholder, detects light/dark and honors --sprk-ui-scale, and renders via a shared Navigator body component registered against SprkSidePaneHost. Renders a safe empty state when no Xrm is present.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>Per spec FR-01 surface + FR-11 search scaffold and plan.md Phase 4 task 040. The Navigator body is authored as a shared component so a phase-2 dashboard widget can reuse it without rework (NFR-08). Depends on the framework host + registry (011) and the deployed sprk_navitem entity (021). Mirrors the shipping CalendarSidePane / EventDetailSidePane Vite code-page-as-webresource-pane reference impls; theme + scale via scaledTheme/useUiScale (NFR-07).</background>
    <relevant-files>
