  </context>
  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-006">The pane body ships as a Vite code-page bundle hosted as a pageType:'webresource' pane (CalendarSidePane pattern) — NOT a classic HTML web resource and NOT a per-form handler (Path C comply; flag for adr-check).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 tokens only; portal FluentProvider re-wrap; code-page theme detection (prefers-color-scheme + theme URL param); --sprk-ui-scale via scaledTheme/useUiScale (NFR-07).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Any @spaarke/ui-components code consumed MUST stay React-16/17-safe (no createRoot in the shared lib; JSXElement not JSX.Element). The code page itself is React 19.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Host-context only — no BFF, no plugin, no per-form web resource. All later data access is Xrm.WebApi.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Author the Navigator body as a shared component so a phase-2 dashboard widget can register it without rework (NFR-08); no widget registration ships in r1.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Code page = Vite npm run build (NOT build:prod); cache-clear (rm -rf dist/ node_modules/.vite/ .vite/) + recompile @spaarke/ui-components first; verify a known string in the built HTML.</constraint>
  </constraints>
